# Lost Kingdom (ToAU 13, mission.toau.lost_kingdom). A level 75 Warrior of Bastok with it current and the Vial of
# Spectral Scent, in Aht Urhgan Whitegate: Naja 3071. Nashmau: Pyopyoroon 275. Caedarva Mire: Jazaraat's Headstone at
# status 0: cutscene 8, finished: status 1; at status 1: Jazaraat spawned with its enmity on the char (no action); again
# (spawned): nothing; Jazaraat killed: status 2; the headstone: cutscene 9, finished: the vial deleted, completed (the
# Ephramadian Gold Coin, The Dolphin Crest current). Section 2 (completed): the headstone with the coin: the zone's
# JAZARAATS_HEADSTONE message; without it (a GM took it): the coin given again.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger Nashmau/Pyopyoroon/onTrigger CaedarvaMire/Jazaraats_Headstone/onTrigger CaedarvaMire/Jazaraat/onMobDeath CaedarvaMire/onEventFinish/8 CaedarvaMire/onEventFinish/9
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau LostKingdom current
keyitem VialOfSpectralScent
login
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3071
finish
warp 22.112,0,20 Nashmau
trigger Pyopyoroon                      # 275
finish
warp -385,6,-565 CaedarvaMire
trigger Jazaraats_Headstone             # status 0, the vial: 8
finish                                  # status 1
trigger Jazaraats_Headstone             # status 1: Jazaraat spawned
finish-if-event
trigger Jazaraats_Headstone             # spawned: nothing
finish-if-event
kill JAZARAAT                           # status 2
trigger Jazaraats_Headstone             # 9
finish                                  # completed
trigger Jazaraats_Headstone             # section 2, the coin held: the message
finish-if-event
delkeyitem EphramadianGoldCoin          # a GM
trigger Jazaraats_Headstone             # the coin given again
finish-if-event
